     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div vlink=\"#954F72\" link=\"#0563C1\" lang=\"EN-US\">\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:12pt\">Dear all,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>please see the attached job advert.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">From: </span>\r\n</b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">&quot;Robinson, Hugh&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hugh.r...@mso.umt.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Date: </b>Tuesday, November 17, 2020 at 12:18 PM<br>\r\n<b>To: </b>Wildlife Biology Faculty &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">wbi...@mso.umt.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject: </b>Panthera job posting</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi All,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Panthera is looking for a quantitative ecologist/biometrician for our Missoula office.  Job details attached.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Please distribute to anyone you think might be qualified and/or interested.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">HR</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#3b3838\">Hugh Robinson |\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\">Director, Applied Science</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#3b3838\"><br>\r\nPanthera | Natural Sciences 114, University of Montana</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#3b3838\">32 Campus Drive Missoula MT 59812</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#3b3838\">T <a href=\"tel:(406)%20243-2876\" value=\"+14062432876\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">406-243-2876</a> |E\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><a href rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">hrob...@panthera.org</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:4.0pt;color:#3b3838\">\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#3b3838\">Visit us at </span>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><a href=\"http://www.panthera.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.panthera.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494115812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cts_lZM76EIF-r4Ic_Ns2\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">www.panthera.org</span></a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/hmecology/attach/5a98a51f7b6d0/image001.jpg?part=0.0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Panthera_LogoSignature\" style=\"width:1.5729in;min-height:.6145in\" width=\"151\" height=\"59\" border=\"0\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
